>Otherwise can somebody give me a few headers from that group so i can 
>determine at which site up the chain the filtering maybe starting.

Maybe this ought to be a FAQ.

Very few sites in Australia get alt.binaries.picture.erotica.*. They
get filtered at munarri, which is the main entry site for news coming
from the USA. Any articles that you see in these newsgroups are crossposts
to other groups that aren't censored, such as alt.binaries.pictures.tasteless.

Other censored groups include all of alt.sex.* and most of alt.drugs.*.

The censorship occurs because the IP link to the USA is partly funded by
NASA, who don't wish to be seen to be funding moral decay. At times in
the past, certain sites that shall remain nameless (Mark V. Shaney
knows who they are) have imported the censored groups and fed them into
the net, but this hasn't been happening for some time.

None of this means that the groups don't exist. They probably exist at
most sites, and you can post to them, but your posts will be confined
to Australia unless you crosspost them to something else.

If you must have these groups, check out the 'How to Receive Banned
Newsgroups FAQ' that gets posted to news.answers. It explains how to
bypass the censorship.


